# Captured from strix with `curl http://192.168.68.63:9100/metrics`, reduced
# to the series RemoteMapper reads, in the manner of homelab-ai-1.prom. The
# homelab_gpu_* series are the fleet collector's amdgpu stage, live since
# 2026-09-23: memory figures are the shared GTT pool (plus the VRAM
# carveout's used pages), never the carveout's capacity, and no power limit
# is published because this kernel's amdgpu exposes no cap.
